@startuml
skinparam defaultFontSize 30
skinparam titleFontSize 30
title DeepResearch Agent 处理时序图

actor 用户 as User
boundary "前端页面" as Frontend
control "DeepResearch Agent" as Agent
control "工作流启动器\nStartWorkflow" as Starter
control "研究导向聊天模型节点" as PlanNode
control "Tavily 检索工具节点" as SearchNode
control "Tavily HTTP 工具" as TavilyTool
control "结果整理聊天模型节点" as SummaryNode

User -> Frontend : 提交研究问题
activate Frontend

Frontend -> Agent : 发送 query、task_id、user_id 等参数
activate Agent

Agent -> Starter : 启动 DeepResearchWorkflowID
activate Starter
Starter --> Agent : 返回工作流上下文
deactivate Starter

Agent -> PlanNode : 研究问题理解与拆解\n生成检索关键词和研究目标
activate PlanNode
PlanNode --> Agent : 返回检索导向结果
deactivate PlanNode

Agent -> SearchNode : 进入工具调用阶段
activate SearchNode
SearchNode -> TavilyTool : 执行实时搜索
activate TavilyTool
TavilyTool --> SearchNode : 返回多源检索结果
deactivate TavilyTool
SearchNode --> Agent : 返回检索结果
deactivate SearchNode



Agent -> SummaryNode : 整理证据并总结研究结论
activate SummaryNode
SummaryNode --> Agent : 返回研究结论、关键要点、补充说明
deactivate SummaryNode

Agent --> Frontend : 返回最终研究结果
deactivate Agent

Frontend --> User : 展示研究结果
deactivate Frontend
@enduml